WEBVTT

00:00:06.560 --> 00:00:07.430
Yuu-san!

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:09.070
Toto, stop!

00:00:13.560 --> 00:00:15.070
Welcome back, Daddy!

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.240
Hey, you look really happy.

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.160
No way.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:27.120
We did it!

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.010
Yeah, partner!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.090
Together, we're invincible!

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.550
Oh, I almost forgot.

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.580
We have to save the princess.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:38.850
That's right.

00:00:43.030 --> 00:00:47.140
Okay, the princess's kiss is waiting!

00:00:47.140 --> 00:00:48.230
Yeah!

00:00:59.410 --> 00:01:02.290
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:25.450
<b>The Lord with You in Dreams and the Town of Oblivion (Part 2)</b>

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:28.210
Eleanor...

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:30.870
Thank you for coming to save me,

00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:33.160
my prince!

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:37.530
I've missed...

00:02:38.330 --> 00:02:40.610
I've missed you for so long!

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:45.680
Hey, Mister. What's this house?

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.230
I don't remember a house being here.

00:02:48.490 --> 00:02:50.410
Will they get mad if we go in?

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:52.890
If you're curious about what's inside,
 want to go in?

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:58.520
It may be a clue to what you se—<i>pumpthwack</i>!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:04.090
Looks like I won't be escorting you in.

00:03:05.190 --> 00:03:07.180
Leave this to me.

00:03:08.090 --> 00:03:08.960
Who are you?

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.620
I'm confident that I know
 how to escort a lady.

00:03:11.940 --> 00:03:14.080
I've practiced many times.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.760
He's mad!

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:21.780
The rat's mad!

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.290
I'm trying to look cool, you jerk!

00:03:23.290 --> 00:03:26.340
I want a pretty bride, too!

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.770
He's jealous!

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.470
He's a jealous rat!

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:30.420
Shaddup!

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.820
Run!

00:03:31.820 --> 00:03:32.810
Sheesh...

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.600
You were right.

00:03:36.600 --> 00:03:37.360
Huh?

00:03:37.360 --> 00:03:40.040
A rat with a nasty mouth 
and a sarcastic mind,

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:43.860
but who's kind, warm, and gentle...

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:46.160
He's a wonderful partner, huh?

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.370
I never told anybody but you.

00:03:49.170 --> 00:03:52.330
You were the only one who listened.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.440
I'm not boring you?

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:58.520
I love your stories.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:03:59.490
Really?

00:03:59.490 --> 00:04:00.590
Yeah.

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:05.450
Even when the bad dragon shows up,
in the end everyone becomes friends again,

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:07.720
and Squeak is always by your side.

00:04:08.340 --> 00:04:10.180
So tell me more!

00:04:11.230 --> 00:04:14.300
To tell you the truth,

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.950
I wanted to hear more stories from you.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:20.950
But still, you told those stories 
for my sake, didn't you?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:21.740
Yes.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:23.350
Thank you.

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.740
Your stories were always so kind.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:30.730
Your stories became my dreams.

00:04:33.770 --> 00:04:34.980
He's mad!

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:37.020
Wait, you jerks!

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.570
He's mad!

00:04:37.660 --> 00:04:39.210
I am not!

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.210
I thought that with you,

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.970
I could make my dreams reality.

00:04:43.590 --> 00:04:44.470
Dreams?

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:49.470
I'd bake delicious bread every 
day, and you'd draw picture books.

00:04:50.130 --> 00:04:54.060
The village kids would love your stories...

00:04:54.630 --> 00:04:57.440
I dreamed of that every day.

00:04:59.440 --> 00:05:03.270
I failed as a picture book author.

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:07.970
Without you, I forgot how to dream.

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:10.430
I could only remember the painful things.

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.700
I had nothing but regrets.

00:05:13.420 --> 00:05:15.150
When I was with you,

00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:17.760
every day was so wonderful that 
I couldn't tell the difference

00:05:17.760 --> 00:05:19.590
between dreams and reality, but...

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:23.340
You're gone now.

00:05:23.650 --> 00:05:26.090
We can't help it, Jean.

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:29.730
Every new encounter is the 
beginning of a goodbye.

00:05:30.520 --> 00:05:34.810
And every goodbye is the 
beginning of a new encounter.

00:05:35.710 --> 00:05:38.060
Without you, I can't dream.

00:05:38.600 --> 00:05:39.300
You were my—

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:41.770
You were my salvation.

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:45.870
You saved me.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:49.230
You took me by the hand and 
led me out of this room.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:51.790
Just like a real prince!

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:55.260
You were always smiling at me.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.100
And that made me so happy.

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:02.210
But were you really happy?

00:06:02.790 --> 00:06:06.050
Were you really happy with me?

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:09.760
If I hadn't taken you away,
you might still be—

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:11.180
I was happy.

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:17.850
I'd never dreamed until you 
showed me all those worlds.

00:06:18.390 --> 00:06:21.110
By sharing your dreams with you,

00:06:21.110 --> 00:06:24.730
the same old world around me 
looked different every day.

00:06:25.080 --> 00:06:28.990
I was so happy when I was with you.

00:06:31.470 --> 00:06:32.600
I see.

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:35.150
Let's eat!

00:06:35.950 --> 00:06:39.410
Sorry I'm not home more often.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:40.660
It's fine.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:44.710
How long will you be gone 
on your next journey?

00:06:45.320 --> 00:06:49.100
My healer for this trip has a habit 
of changing their mind a lot.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.250
I'll probably be gone a long time.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:53.010
But I'll be back by winter.

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:54.220
Winter?

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.080
Yeah.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:59.540
I wonder how much you'll have 
grown by the time I get back.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.950
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:07:04.160 --> 00:07:06.900
I'm really worried, though!

00:07:06.900 --> 00:07:09.030
He's got a small son to think about,

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.570
and yet he still goes missing on his journey!

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.550
<i>Dad... you liar.</i>

00:07:26.860 --> 00:07:29.420
Yuu-san! Yuu-san!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.930
What does this say?

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:34.930
Oh, it says...

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.200
Thanks!

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.170
Now I can read the rest of the book.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:42.440
Yuu-san!

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.710
It's a nice day outside!

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.340
Let's go outside!

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:49.440
No...

00:07:49.440 --> 00:07:54.280
The books said it's no fun 
to stay inside all day.

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:57.390
And I want to go outside!

00:07:57.390 --> 00:08:00.970
And I'll be lonely out there without you!

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.430
Fine.

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.210
Thank you!

00:08:06.500 --> 00:08:09.920
Yuu-san, don't cry.

00:08:10.220 --> 00:08:11.670
I'm not crying!

00:08:11.670 --> 00:08:16.180
There must be a reason 
why that monster bit you!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.890
I don't know why!

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.060
We were friends for so long...

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:24.470
Dad's a liar!

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:30.210
Yuu-san, you can't sleep?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:32.010
I'm fine.

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:34.570
So read a book with me.

00:08:35.170 --> 00:08:39.330
I'll read you this new 
book I got about ghosts.

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:42.790
Why are you reading me a scary picture 
book when I already can't sleep?

00:08:42.790 --> 00:08:45.230
Are stories about ghosts scary?

00:08:45.230 --> 00:08:46.710
I'm not scared.

00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.090
I'll read it to you, 
then, so close your eyes!

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:51.800
Don't treat me like a kid.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:56.250
You're not going to leave me, right, Merc?

00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.510
Next to you is where I belong, Yuu-san.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.890
We'll be together forever.

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:07.910
Yeah...

00:09:14.380 --> 00:09:15.950
Yuu-san!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.870
Yuu-san!

00:09:19.120 --> 00:09:19.950
I...

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:22.490
What happened?

00:09:23.420 --> 00:09:26.500
I was reliving memories 
from when I was little.

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:32.150
Dad didn't come back that winter,
 and I was so alone...

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:34.510
Why did you dream about something like that?

00:09:35.790 --> 00:09:37.010
I don't know.

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:41.260
Yuu-san, look!

00:09:41.480 --> 00:09:43.270
That boy!

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.500
That's a monster!

00:10:02.310 --> 00:10:03.360
That's...

00:10:03.760 --> 00:10:07.810
Yuu-san, that monster's been healed!

00:10:09.210 --> 00:10:12.790
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:10:14.870 --> 00:10:19.590
That stuffed animal of Squeak I made...
thanks for giving it to her.

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.850
I wanted to give it to her myself, but...

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:27.420
You and me and her...

00:10:27.420 --> 00:10:30.120
I wanted to read the picture 
books you made together.

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:34.780
I wanted her to experience the 
wonderful dreams you created.

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:38.820
I don't know how to dream.

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:42.080
Or what to do with her...

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:46.580
I don't know how to talk to her.

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.850
I can't be like a mom or a dad.

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:55.120
I didn't know what she wanted.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:59.230
You said you were happy being with me...

00:10:59.670 --> 00:11:03.530
But does she feel the same way?

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.930
I don't think so.

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:12.060
What's important is whether 
you love her or not.

00:11:13.030 --> 00:11:14.480
Of course I do!

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.870
Then dream with her.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:20.340
Dream the same dreams.

00:11:20.340 --> 00:11:22.030
Share them with each other.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:26.540
Don't worry.

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:30.100
Your dreams will always be within you.

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:31.490
Remember that.

00:11:32.970 --> 00:11:34.970
Listen for the voice,

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.830
and call out to it.

00:11:37.310 --> 00:11:41.560
Then the dreams will always be there for you.

00:11:44.300 --> 00:11:45.870
It's so cute!

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.510
Is this my room?

00:11:48.510 --> 00:11:49.850
It must be.

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:52.350
Are those pictures of your family?

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:53.450
Yeah.

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:56.330
That's Daddy holding me when I'm a baby.

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:58.860
And Uncle Luciano is in the one next to it.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.650
Why's he crying?

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:05.990
Because he was sad I was born, I'm sure.

00:12:05.990 --> 00:12:06.910
Why?

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:11.630
Because Mom is gone because of me.

00:12:11.630 --> 00:12:13.450
Did your Dad say that?

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:14.670
No.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:18.920
But Dad doesn't love me.

00:12:20.600 --> 00:12:23.340
Dad never stays with me.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:26.270
So I don't know what he thinks about me.

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:28.930
He won't read me stories from picture books.

00:12:28.930 --> 00:12:32.370
He's not like the families I 
read about in books at all.

00:12:34.230 --> 00:12:37.560
Maybe I'd be happier with Mister...

00:12:38.540 --> 00:12:42.150
Will she want me?

00:12:42.760 --> 00:12:45.780
That's something for you and her to decide.

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:50.470
Now, you've saved the princess, 
and the story is over.

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:53.200
You have to go on to your next adventure.

00:12:53.760 --> 00:12:56.950
It's time to save a new princess.

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:59.290
You have to wake up from your dream.

00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.640
I'll need an alarm clock.

00:13:03.210 --> 00:13:05.040
The sound of a pot and a ladle,

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.260
or hands shaking me awake,

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:07.980
or perhaps the light of the morning sun?

00:13:09.420 --> 00:13:11.840
The light is right here.

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:17.220
You kept my Bright Stone, didn't you?

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.370
Take her by the hand and go.

00:13:19.370 --> 00:13:22.670
You're the only one who can.

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:25.190
Did you notice?

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:28.250
In this world, you can 
take any form you like,

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:29.990
but you've always kept that form.

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:32.410
The one she knows.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:38.630
You always knew what it was you wanted.

00:13:41.790 --> 00:13:43.760
Don't make that face.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:46.050
I'm always here for you.

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.010
As long as you dream,

00:13:48.010 --> 00:13:50.760
we'll always be there for you.

00:13:51.410 --> 00:13:56.400
And someday, we'll share the same dream.

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:58.270
I'll keep waiting for that day.

00:13:59.590 --> 00:14:01.190
I was willing to die here,

00:14:01.760 --> 00:14:04.450
if you wanted me to.

00:14:05.740 --> 00:14:09.280
Liar. You know you couldn't do that.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:10.620
Here.

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.820
Borrow my rapier.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:14.400
Shatter it.

00:14:14.990 --> 00:14:16.040
Thank you.

00:14:31.800 --> 00:14:33.220
Goodbye,

00:14:33.930 --> 00:14:35.090
Eleanor.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:42.210
Are you waiting alone, too?

00:14:42.210 --> 00:14:43.710
Aren't you lonely?

00:14:43.710 --> 00:14:46.600
I can hear a voice, you see.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.240
I can't.

00:14:49.240 --> 00:14:50.920
Of course not.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:53.120
You've put your hands over your ears.

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:58.320
You've blocked off your heart behind 
strong walls and a tiny door.

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:00.500
But don't worry.

00:15:00.950 --> 00:15:05.250
As long as there's a door, 
you can always leave.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:08.870
Close your eyes and listen for the voice.

00:15:08.870 --> 00:15:10.720
And call out to it.

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:13.740
Cosette!

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:16.140
Cosette!

00:15:16.650 --> 00:15:17.640
I can hear it!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.270
I can—

00:15:20.700 --> 00:15:21.870
Cosette!

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:22.690
Daddy!

00:15:23.160 --> 00:15:24.030
Daddy!

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.940
So this girl's the new princess?

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.610
Looking for my partner?

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:33.370
I'll take you to him.

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.740
Squeak!

00:15:35.150 --> 00:15:36.150
Cosette!

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:37.240
Daddy!

00:15:37.820 --> 00:15:39.330
Out of the way,

00:15:39.330 --> 00:15:40.980
princess!

00:15:44.970 --> 00:15:46.160
Daddy!

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:50.420
Cosette...

00:15:50.870 --> 00:15:51.890
Daddy!

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:54.930
I won't let you have her!

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:58.240
You left her alone.

00:15:59.130 --> 00:16:01.560
What is it you seek?

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:05.310
Is she what you really want?

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:09.840
If she's not, I won't let you take her.

00:16:10.940 --> 00:16:12.950
If she doesn't want you to take her,

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:16.410
she'll be alone forever in a sad world.

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:20.370
The two of us will decide 
for ourselves if it's sad.

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:23.210
I won't leave her alone in a world of dreams.

00:16:24.130 --> 00:16:25.660
She's my daughter.

00:16:26.280 --> 00:16:30.040
When she grabbed my finger 
for the first time...

00:16:30.800 --> 00:16:33.130
She became the family

00:16:33.630 --> 00:16:35.890
that my wife and I dreamed of!

00:16:37.900 --> 00:16:39.340
I...

00:16:40.110 --> 00:16:43.360
I don't want to be alone anymore.

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.740
Who am I?

00:16:46.150 --> 00:16:48.150
Why am I here?

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:49.690
Mister...

00:16:51.260 --> 00:16:54.350
Who am I waiting for?

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:56.370
Who...

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:01.300
That's...

00:17:01.860 --> 00:17:02.710
A Bright Stone?

00:17:03.860 --> 00:17:06.710
Delivery for you, Shtoruiyu.

00:17:20.980 --> 00:17:22.660
Hey, Shtoruiyu.

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:23.680
What?

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:27.630
There's a test on escorting 
a lady in etiquette class.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.570
Practice with me.

00:17:29.770 --> 00:17:31.570
Certainly.

00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:33.320
As you wish, master.

00:17:34.800 --> 00:17:36.290
Hey, Shtoruiyu.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:37.030
What?

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:40.160
Someday, let's travel the world together.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:42.000
That's a wonderful idea.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:46.070
Right now I'm studying all the time 
and don't have time to go outside.

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:49.750
But with you, I know I can 
go on a wonderful journey.

00:17:50.050 --> 00:17:51.190
It's a promise!

00:17:51.530 --> 00:17:52.370
Yeah.

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:55.680
Hey,

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.750
Shtoruiyu...

00:17:58.440 --> 00:17:59.350
What?

00:18:00.610 --> 00:18:01.970
I'm sorry.

00:18:02.670 --> 00:18:05.650
I made that promise with you,

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:07.980
but I don't think I can keep it.

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.710
Don't worry.

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:12.930
If you can't move,

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:15.470
I'll carry you around the world!

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:19.240
As you can see, I'm bigger than you.

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:21.680
It'll be easy to carry you.

00:18:22.100 --> 00:18:25.420
And you practiced escorting so hard.

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:29.250
I'm not a girl.

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:32.280
You'll get better soon, I know it.

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:36.550
Then we can travel the world, 
and see all kinds of things.

00:18:37.070 --> 00:18:38.310
Yeah.

00:18:38.960 --> 00:18:40.040
Someday...

00:18:41.110 --> 00:18:43.900
It would be a like a dream, 
but if it ever came true...

00:18:44.680 --> 00:18:45.730
Hey.

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:48.860
Thank you...

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:51.540
...for being my...

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:55.780
...friend.

00:18:57.630 --> 00:19:01.260
You're my only friend.

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:04.800
I'm waiting for the day 
we can keep our promise.

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:12.250
Now, I can finally keep my promise.

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.760
Let's go!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:19.930
We'll travel the world together!

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.390
You're alone, too, aren't you?

00:19:27.480 --> 00:19:28.850
Thank you.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:32.350
You always gave me those dreams to see.

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:35.980
And now I have a dream for you!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:40.490
Cosette...

00:19:42.180 --> 00:19:44.600
A present for you.

00:19:47.200 --> 00:19:51.210
If you ever want to dream again,

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.720
that lantern will light your path.

00:19:54.210 --> 00:19:56.460
You may never need it, though.

00:19:58.540 --> 00:20:03.220
I wasn't lying when I said I wanted
 to dream new dreams with you.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:04.870
Yeah,

00:20:04.870 --> 00:20:06.060
me, too.

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:09.060
Okay, it's time to say goodbye!

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:12.700
Let's go, until we've seen 
every dream there is to see!

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:19.810
It's beautiful...

00:20:20.410 --> 00:20:22.970
It's the light of shattered Bright Stones.

00:20:24.930 --> 00:20:28.490
I met Squeak, Daddy!

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:32.250
He and I were a famous pair of adventurers.

00:20:33.030 --> 00:20:34.980
We even defeated a fire-breathing dragon.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:36.210
Really?

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:37.250
Yup. We flew with magic boots,

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:43.870
and challenged a golem to 
attain a legendary rapier.

00:20:43.870 --> 00:20:45.700
Or swam through the sea of stars...

00:20:47.270 --> 00:20:48.560
In my dreams, that is.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:52.570
Will I not see Squeak anymore when I wake up?

00:20:52.570 --> 00:20:54.320
You will.

00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:57.550
I'll tell you about the adventures 
we had before you go to sleep.

00:20:57.550 --> 00:20:58.570
Okay!

00:20:59.130 --> 00:21:01.350
Are you okay?

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:05.660
Jeantore! Cosette!

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:12.020
You look kinda silly, Uncle.

00:21:12.020 --> 00:21:13.470
That's so mean...

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:15.370
I was kidding.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:18.170
Thanks for coming to save me.

00:22:56.150 --> 00:22:59.960
So the ghosts were all illusions 
created by that monster.

00:23:00.900 --> 00:23:03.740
Maybe it felt lonely all 
by itself in that castle.

00:23:03.740 --> 00:23:05.690
I'm sure it was!

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:09.690
But, Yuu-san, even if the ghosts 
from the monster were fake,

00:23:09.690 --> 00:23:13.020
what about the boy with the Bright Stone?

00:23:14.090 --> 00:23:15.700
You think he really was...?

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:20.930
Now you won't be sleeping tonight, Yuu-san!

00:23:20.930 --> 00:23:22.840
Don't treat me like a kid!

00:23:25.850 --> 00:23:27.150
It's me, Titi!

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:28.620
It's me, Chacha!

00:23:28.620 --> 00:23:31.370
What a touching story of family love!

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:35.010
I'm sure they'll all eat delicious stew now!

00:23:35.010 --> 00:23:39.190
Next time: "The King of the Song Altar 
and the Diva in a Cage." Part 1!

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>The King of the Song Altar and the Diva in a Cage (Part 1)</b>
